@page
@model TimeDeposit
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Time Deposit";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Time Deposit</div>
        <h3>Watch Your Savings Grow with Guaranteed Higher Returns</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">If you have savings set aside for future goals—such as expanding your farm, building a home, funding your children's education, or securing your retirement—a Time Deposit at Rural Bank of Norala offers a safe, high-yielding way to grow your money.</p>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">Unlike a regular savings account, a Time Deposit locks in your funds for a fixed period at a guaranteed, higher interest rate. You enjoy total peace of mind knowing your hard-earned capital is secure and yielding predictable returns.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Key Benefits</div>
        <h3>Key Benefits of Our Time Deposit Account</h3>

        <table class="data-table" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Feature</th>
                    <th>What It Means for You</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Higher Guaranteed Rates</strong></td>
                    <td>Enjoy competitive interest rates significantly higher than standard savings accounts.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Flexible Term Options</strong></td>
                    <td>Choose placement terms that match your financial timeline: 30, 90, 180, or 360 days (1 year).</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Fixed Yields</strong></td>
                    <td>Your interest rate is locked in at opening, protecting your return from market fluctuations.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Automatic Renewal</strong></td>
                    <td>Option to automatically roll over your principal or interest upon maturity so your earnings keep compounding.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Collateral Eligible</strong></td>
                    <td>Use your Time Deposit certificate as collateral for low-interest back-to-back loans when emergency cash is needed.</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">How It Works</div>
        <h3>How Time Deposits Work</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:40px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>1. Deposit Capital</h3>
                <p>Deposit your funds (e.g., ₱10,000 minimum).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>2. Lock-In Term</h3>
                <p>Earn locked, higher interest for 30–360 days.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>3. Payout / Maturity</h3>
                <p>Collect your principal plus full interest.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:30px; background:var(--color-cream);">
            <p><strong>Pro Tip for Farmers &amp; Business Owners:</strong> Many of our clients align their Time Deposit maturity dates with planting seasons or major inventory purchases to ensure cash is available exactly when needed.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Requirements &amp; How to Apply</div>
        <h3>Requirements to Open a Time Deposit</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">Opening or converting your savings into a Time Deposit is quick and hassle-free:</p>

        <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>For Existing Account Holders</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Present 1 Valid Government ID.</li>
                    <li>Fill out a simple Time Deposit Placement Form at our main office.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>For New Clients</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Valid Primary ID (e.g., PhilID / ePhilID, Passport, Driver's License, UMID, SSS, Postal ID).</li>
                    <li>Proof of Address (Latest utility bill or Barangay Clearance).</li>
                    <li>Two (2) 2x2 ID photos.</li>
                    <li>Minimum Initial Placement Amount (Contact our team for current minimum balance guidelines).</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3 style="margin-top:50px;">3 Easy Steps to Secure Your Investment</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>1. Visit Our Main Office</h3>
                <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-soil); font-weight:600;">In-person assistance</p>
                <p>Drop by the Rural Bank of Norala main office and speak with our Customer Service Officers to check our latest competitive interest rates.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>2. Select Your Term</h3>
                <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-soil); font-weight:600;">30 to 360 days</p>
                <p>Choose the maturity timeline (e.g., 3 or 12 months) and placement option (Roll-over principal only, or Principal + Interest).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>3. Receive Your Certificate</h3>
                <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--color-soil); font-weight:600;">Same-day issuance</p>
                <p>Deposit your placement funds and receive your official Certificate of Time Deposit (CTD) as proof of your investment.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Deposit Protection</div>
        <h3>Protected Investment</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">Your deposits are insured by the Philippine Deposit Insurance Corporation (PDIC) up to ₱500,000 per depositor. Rural Bank of Norala is proudly supervised by the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas (BSP).</p>
    </div>
</section>


